SUMMARY:Mix in the City | Looks That Serve x The Durham
DESCRIPTION:Looks That Serve brings their Mix in the City shopping event to the Roof for an evening of fashion\, local makers\, and community connection. \nFounded by Durham creator Devana Turner\, Looks That Serve produces events that give the fashion community space to meet\, discover\, and give back. This edition lands on the Roof with downtown Durham as the backdrop and a lineup of local vendors and activations on site. \nOn the floor: \nLuxury Anew — Curated luxury designer handbags \nNote and Accord — A custom fragrance bar. Guests blend their own signature scent to take home. \nColor Analysis by Yvonne Cano — Mini on-site sessions with a color analysis and personal brand expert \nMusic by DJ Gemynii \nNo tickets. No reservation. Come as you are.
URL:https://downtowndurham.com/event/mix-in-the-city-looks-that-serve-x-the-durham/
LOCATION:The Durham Hotel\, 315 E Chapel Hill Street\, Durham\, NC\, 27701\, United States
CATEGORIES:Shopping
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://downtowndurham.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/IMG_4981.jpeg
ORGANIZER;CN="The Durham Hotel":MAILTO:events@thedurham.com
