SUMMARY:Gimme Gimme Disco
DESCRIPTION:America’s most ICONIC disco party\, Gimme Gimme Disco\, is coming to Durham on 22 May 2026\, and it’s bringing nothing but glitter\, grooves\, and pure dance-floor joy. \nIf you can’t get enough of ABBA\, this is THE dance party for you! Gimme Gimme Disco is a DJ-based dance party spinning all your favorite ABBA anthems\, plus nonstop disco classics from the ’70s and ’80s. Expect hits from the Bee Gees\, Donna Summer\, Cher\, and more\, the kind of songs that make it impossible to stand still. Come ready to lay all your love on the dance floor\, sing at the top of your lungs\, and dance like nobody’s watching. \nSo honey honey\, take a chance. Put on your best disco fit\, don’t forget your dancing shoes\, but leave your worries behind. Whether you’re a lifelong dancing queen or just here for the vibes\, your crown awaits. This is the best disco since 1980\, sweaty\, euphoric\, and packed with feel-good energy from start to finish at Stanczyks on 22 May 2026.
URL:https://downtowndurham.com/event/gimme-gimme-disco-4/
LOCATION:Stanczyks\, 1007 W Main St\, Durham\, 27701
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://downtowndurham.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/banner.jpg
ORGANIZER;CN="Gimme Gimme Disco":MAILTO:info@stanczyksdurham.com
GEO:36.0006764;-78.9107923
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=Stanczyks 1007 W Main St Durham 27701;X-APPLE-RADIUS=500;X-TITLE=1007 W Main St:geo:-78.9107923,36.0006764
END:VEVENT
