SUMMARY:2nd Annual VegHead Grill Out
DESCRIPTION:Veggie Lovers Unite! Join us on The Veranda at Motorco Music Hall for a vibrant food event celebrating grilled and flavorful veggies. Our state-of-the-art Argentinian Parrilla grill will be firing up an exclusive vegetarian-only menu\, cooked to perfection by Chef Mikey! We’ll have a full bar open and DJ Gemynii keeping the vibes high! \nTo make things easy (and guarantee you don’t miss out)\, we highly recommend preordering your plate ahead of time\, saving $2 off with advance preorder purchase. If you’re more of a “go with the flow” type\, we’ll have plates and a la carte options available day-of. \n 
URL:https://downtowndurham.com/event/2nd-annual-veghead-grill-out/
