SUMMARY:Pilates Class
DESCRIPTION:It’s pilates for people of all levels of experience – come feel the burn! \nCome experience a pilates class with Pilates Addiction. You’ll learn new exercises to add to your routine while having fun and sharing a beverage of your choice with other awesome people. Class will be held outdoors unless weather prohibits\, then it’ll be inside the taproom. Your ticket includes your first beverage – including beer\, wine\, cider\, non-alcoholic options and more – so sign up today! \nGet your spot here! \n 
